
######## Friday, the 2nd of January, 1931 — the day after New Year's Day (cold and wet (-2° to 6°C)) ########
   ◆ Ada's past: He was a steady, hard-working young fellow, and, when he died, left enough to keep her comfortably.
   ◆ Arthur's past: He remembered gratefully the days when, as a boy, he had been enabled to purchase a microscope, out of his pocket-money, and so had taken the first steps towards becoming a naturalist.
   ◆ Mr. Thomas's past: He was honest, punctual, and methodical, in all his transactions.
   📅 Ada means to: Monday: washes the office towels
   📅 Arthur means to: Monday: goes to bed early, and so to sleep soundly
   📅 Mr. Thomas means to: Monday: goes to Brighton for a holiday and would return on Thursday night
