began the New Year by setting Mr. Hale to balance the quarterly ledger, and spoke to him about the gloomy outlook of trade, which is reported to affect coal and cotton more than other industries.
   ☾ Ada: She dreamt that her sister Lizzie was dead, and that she herself was sitting beside the body, in a little room at Paddock Wood, with Bert kneeling at her knees, and sobbing.
